<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>attack success rate (<math id="S3.F5.sf2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>) evaluated on Natural Questions</figcaption>
