="lstnumberx157.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">t</span><span id="lstnumberx157.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">know</span><span id="lstnumberx157.26" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">".</span>
